        "original_id": "83b10e6e-4b80-5b2c-9afc-abccba14370d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Elyesa Bazna, James Mason, Ulysses Diello\n- Works: 5 Fingers\n- Roles: Cicero, secret agent\n- Organizations: Nazi Germany\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- Elyesa Bazna was born on 28 July 1904 and died on 21 December 1970.\n- Elyesa Bazna was infrequently referred to as Iliaz Bazna and Ilyaz Bazna.\n- During World War II, Elyesa Bazna worked as a secret agent for Nazi Germany under the code name Cicero.\n- In the film 5 Fingers, James Mason played Ulysses Diello, a character based on Elyesa Bazna.\n- In the film 5 Fingers, Ulysses Diello is identified with the name Cicero.",
